;; REPL/deb-staleness-proof.repl — focused driver for M3 #12 Part-2 (deb-staleness).
;; Loads the AQP-comprehensive prefix ONLY through [6.4]_AQP-EXHAUSTIVE-COLLECT.repl
;; (which stands up the class-1 vault/treasury FVT + singular scores used by CL01/CL02),
;; then exercises the deb-refresh / mirror-resync path via TX-AQP-DEB* in that file.
