;;The result was "Module KBN has no such member: A_Step01" partway through, killing the run.
;;deploy-stage02.repl IS this block plus [Z]_Reads, KBN, AQP-BOOT and Step0, so it replaces both
;;this and the hand-rolled AQP-BOOT transactions that used to follow.
